dmg-core UDIF reader, Apache-2.0 (source derivative)
----------------------------------------------------

exav-unpack's UDIF (DMG) reader is vendored from dmg-core 0.1.2 and changed to
decode XZ with lzma-rust2 instead of lzma-rs. Licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (text below). Upstream ships no NOTICE file.

Upstream: https://crates.io/crates/dmg-core
Copyright (c) Albert Hui / SecurityRonin.


